198291939693", "personaname": "Wraithix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198291939693/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2470, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2191, "last_played": 1640100606, "avatar": "92c26a1ab62acb328558d35eed6a25477e4bbea3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I figured that I should try the this game before RiskOfRain2 and didnt really expect much but ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ ITS SO GOOD DESPITE BEING LIKE 8 YEARS OLD.The character all feel different from each other,the items have very nice designs,the enemies are these giant monsters and golems while your character is just a small dude just trying his damn hardest to not die XD.It was also different from all other roguelikes I have played as of now so its really unique.In game you can find these logs of the different enemies (also items) that tell you about them and you can really feel the amount of personality, love and effort that went into this game when you read it. 9/10 really reccomend it to anyone who is familiar with roguelikes.If you arent maybe try an easier roguelike first 'cuz it might frustrate you when you first begin.(I reccomend Hades)", "timestamp_created": 1615545019, "timestamp_updated": 1615545019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88281100", "author": {"steamid": "76561198252431798", "personaname": "weezzee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mikuhaver/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 70, "playtime_forever": 589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 408, "last_played": 1654244437, "avatar": "ff1633ac617ae0b05d075c584a7c20c8def52044"}, "language": "